WEBVTT

00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:02.770
Welcome to Anglia Educate!

00:00:02.820 --> 00:00:04.080
Here’s your quick tour.

00:00:04.580 --> 00:00:06.240
This is your dashboard.

00:00:06.580 --> 00:00:08.960
Start here, every time you study.

00:00:09.300 --> 00:00:12.000
Your next live lesson is always at the top…

00:00:12.300 --> 00:00:15.280
and every other page lives down the side.

00:00:16.630 --> 00:00:19.860
Your plan for the week comes in three parts.

00:00:19.910 --> 00:00:23.140
New learning is this week’s brand-new topic.

00:00:23.190 --> 00:00:27.727
Missed work returning is anything from an earlier week you didn’t get to.

00:00:27.777 --> 00:00:31.060
And Revision brings back points you’ve already practised,

00:00:31.110 --> 00:00:33.170
just before you’d forget them.

00:00:34.320 --> 00:00:36.780
Your weekly task list has a video,

00:00:36.880 --> 00:00:40.460
notes, a quiz and a task for every point.

00:00:40.760 --> 00:00:42.830
And each point ticks itself off,

00:00:42.880 --> 00:00:45.500
once its quiz and task are done.

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:50.190
Quizzes mark themselves in seconds, and explain every answer.

00:00:50.240 --> 00:00:52.590
You get one go per quiz each week,

00:00:52.640 --> 00:00:54.540
so make it count.

00:00:55.040 --> 00:00:57.310
Tasks are answered right on the page,

00:00:57.360 --> 00:00:58.857
and save as you type.

00:00:58.907 --> 00:01:00.990
But handing in is final!

00:01:01.040 --> 00:01:03.710
Then Ali or Nadia marks it personally,

00:01:03.760 --> 00:01:06.300
with feedback on every question.

00:01:06.800 --> 00:01:11.180
Do a few, and Tasks and Grades shows the grade you’re working towards.

00:01:11.680 --> 00:01:12.460
Stuck?

00:01:12.760 --> 00:01:16.540
Message Ali or Nadia, and attach the task or quiz you’re on.

00:01:19.390 --> 00:01:23.130
And use the search to find anything, fast.

00:01:23.630 --> 00:01:25.450
That’s it, you’re all set.

00:01:25.550 --> 00:01:26.410
Let’s go.
